<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan harvest 96 pct done.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan harvest 96 pct done.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ninety-six percent of Saskatchewan's crops were harvested by Monday, Saskatchewan Wheat Pool said in its final crop report of the year.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite snow and scattered showers, some farmers were still able to make minor harvest progress -- to date farmers harvested approximately 96 percent of the provincial crop,&quot; SWP said.</p>
<p>	   HARVEST PROGRESS TO NOV 4</p>
<p>CROP     SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>S.Wheat   4		  95</p>
<p>Durum     1		  98</p>
<p>Oats	7		  93</p>
<p>Barley    6		  94</p>
<p>Canary Sd 4		  94</p>
<p>Canola    2		  98</p>
<p>Flax     15		  83</p>
<p>Mustard   -		 100</p>
<p>Peas	1		  98</p>
<p>Lentils   -		  99</p>
<p>Rye	 -		 100</p>
<p>W.Wheat   -		 100</p>
<p>--Gilbert Le Gras 204-947-3548</p>
